nistry that this  was a round of precision strikes that  all its intended targets had been struck  the ukrainians are saying that more than  50 cruise missiles were fired during the  course of this large-scale attack and  that 44 was shot down okay thank you for  that update Harry Fawcett there for us  live in Kiev
 

